{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2021-11-23 09:30:00', 'title': 'DISH SELECTS RAKUTEN SYMPHONY FOR OBSERVABILITY AND SERVICE ASSURANCE SOLUTION', 'text': "LITTLETON, COLO. AND TOKYO, NOV. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DISH NETWORK CORPORATION (NASDAQ: DISH) SELECTED RAKUTEN SYMPHONY'S OBSERVABILITY FRAMEWORK (OBF)\xa0TO COLLECT TELEMETRY DATA FROM ALL NETWORK FUNCTIONS THAT WILL ENABLE THE USE OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE AND MACHINE LEARNING TO OPERATE AND OPTIMIZE THE DISH 5G NETWORK."}